  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Turkey - Strengthening governmental and non-governmental capacities to improve the human rights and bodily integrity of women and girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is that women in T&#xfc;rkiye are able to exercise their bodily autonomy; enjoy their sexual and reproductive health and rights; and access opportunities free from all forms of gender based violence, including child, early and forced marriages.</narrative>
  </description>
